 '<bdi>MS Group</bdi> was founded in 2012 and is one of the leading companies marketing and initiating residential projects in Israel’s most sought-after areas, from Tel Aviv and Ramat Gan to Herzliya and Bat Yam. <bdi>MS Group Global</bdi> brings the same knowledge, the same connections and the same professionalism to investments overseas.',
